{
  "vibecad": "0.1",
  "name": "Stage 2 Carriage",
  "material": "6061 aluminum",
  "process": "CNC or waterjet aluminum plate",
  "design_notes": "Stage2 carriage (output). Rides the stage2 MGN9 rails (on stage1) on two MGN9C blocks, M3 counterbored from the front. A -Y tab carries a jaw whose -X face sits at the back of the cascade loop's front strand; a toothed clamp plate pins the strand, so stage2 = 2 x stage1 travel, driven both ways. Payload platform on top with 3 gussets (placed between the MGN screw columns so a hex key reaches every screw). Posed at c2_z0 = c1_z0 + r2_rel + s1. Shared dims: see lift/base_plate design_notes.",
